<title>USA: Ion Laser names Wyatt Cannady president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Ion Laser names Wyatt Cannady president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ion Laser Technology on Tuesday said it named Wyatt Cannady president and chief executive officer, effective the week of February 24th, replacing Lynn Barney who was named vice chairman.</p>
<p>Wyatt is currently chief executive of Spectranetics Corp, which develops, manufactures and markets a variety of intervention cardiology products worldwide, primarily lasers.</p>
<p>ILT manufactures and markets argon and CO2 lasers for dental and industrial applications as well as the chemical kits for tooth whitening procedures.</p>
</text>
